# Infynitae — ~/.config/infynitae/config
#
# How to read it, like a settings menu:
#
#   SETTING="value"              ← what it is set to now: change the value, save the file
#     # What it does
#     # default: value           ← the default (also what a setting left out uses)
#     # options: value · other   ← the other values it takes
#
# When a change applies (in each section's title, or on the setting itself):
#   [save]    the moment you save this file
#   [reload]  on Super+Shift+Backspace (or `infynitae-reload`)
#   [use]     the next time the thing is used
#   [restart] on the next compositor start (Ctrl+Alt+Backspace; closes windows)
#
# A shell file: SETTING="value", '#' starts a comment. `infynitae-settings set KEY VALUE` edits
# one setting and keeps the lines under it.


